# dotnet~ and Documentation~ are hidden from Unity by their trailing ~, not from git: re-include
# them ahead of the build-output rules below, since a global `*~` rule would otherwise drop them.
!dotnet~/
!dotnet~/**
!Documentation~/
!Documentation~/**
bin/
obj/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.swp
.DS_Store
TestResults/
